"900.4.10(317)":{"explanation":"Exception RS 317 sets site specific setbacks (22.0 m from the Birchmount Rd. centreline, 16.0 m from other streets, 2.4 m or 1.2 m from side lot lines) and minimum lot frontage and area for detached and semi-detached houses. No prevailing by-laws apply.","code_refs":"none"},
"900.4.10(165)":{"explanation":"Exception RS 165 allows a maximum of one semi-detached house per lot on the registered plan, sets front, side and named-road setbacks, requires an attached garage to be at least 0.3 m from a side lot line, and requires the parking space to be inside the residential building. No prevailing by-laws apply.","code_refs":"none"}
}}
